WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.967 --> 00:00:01.967
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers

00:00:01.967 --> 00:00:02.969
and this is "Late Night."

00:00:02.969 --> 00:00:03.970
We hope you are all doing well

00:00:03.970 --> 00:00:05.270
tonight and, now,

00:00:05.270 --> 00:00:06.572
let's get to the news.

00:00:06.572 --> 00:00:09.041
California Governor Gavin Newsom
yesterday

00:00:09.041 --> 00:00:10.476
defeated a recall attempt

00:00:10.476 --> 00:00:13.779
by a nearly 2:1 margin
and Newsom was so relieved,

00:00:13.779 --> 00:00:15.515
his hair unclenched.

00:00:15.515 --> 00:00:16.716
[ Laughter ]

00:00:16.716 --> 00:00:18.984
After former
Vice President Mike Pence

00:00:18.984 --> 00:00:22.655
told former President Trump,
during a meeting on January 5th,

00:00:22.655 --> 00:00:26.325
that he didn't have the power
to overturn the 2020 election,

00:00:26.325 --> 00:00:27.726
Trump reportedly said,

00:00:27.726 --> 00:00:32.364
"But wouldn't it be almost cool
to have that power?"

00:00:32.364 --> 00:00:34.801
[ Laughter ]
You're asking Mike Pence
what's cool?

00:00:34.801 --> 00:00:37.069
[ As Pence ]
Well, yeah, I guess
that would be cool,

00:00:37.069 --> 00:00:39.638
but then again,
so is "Godspell."

00:00:39.638 --> 00:00:41.807
[ Laughter ]
-According to a new book,

00:00:41.807 --> 00:00:44.710
Joint Chiefs of Staff
Chairman General Mark Milley

00:00:44.710 --> 00:00:47.246
took steps,
after January's Capitol attack,

00:00:47.246 --> 00:00:49.249
to limit former
President Trump's ability

00:00:49.249 --> 00:00:50.850
to launch a nuclear strike.

00:00:50.850 --> 00:00:53.520
Specifically,
he changed the launch code

00:00:53.520 --> 00:00:55.788
to 11112.

00:00:55.788 --> 00:00:58.091
[ Laughter ]

00:00:58.091 --> 00:01:00.626
According to a new book,
President Biden finds living

00:01:00.626 --> 00:01:03.129
at the White House
to be cold and lonely.

00:01:03.129 --> 00:01:04.597
Said the decorator,

00:01:04.597 --> 00:01:05.598
"Thank you!"

00:01:05.598 --> 00:01:07.433
[ Laughter ]

00:01:07.433 --> 00:01:10.837
According to a new survey,
more than half of Americans said

00:01:10.837 --> 00:01:13.239
that they have never been
in a physical fight.

00:01:13.239 --> 00:01:16.809
"But what if someone
slightly inconveniences you?"

00:01:16.809 --> 00:01:19.112
asked Boston.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:19.112 --> 00:01:20.647
And, finally, a man in England
recently claimed

00:01:20.647 --> 00:01:23.682
he had a McDonald's sandwich
with a pig nipple in it.

00:01:23.682 --> 00:01:24.917
Even more disturbing,

00:01:24.917 --> 00:01:26.319
it was a Filet-O-Fish.

00:01:26.319 --> 00:01:28.654
[ Laughter ]

00:01:28.654 --> 00:01:30.957
Hard to get
more disturbing, but,

00:01:30.957 --> 00:01:32.825
Goldich found that extra gear.

00:01:32.825 --> 00:01:35.261
[ Laughter ]
That was a monologue, everybody.

